s</span><b>${nfmt(bodyCost)} qi · 5 spirit stones</b></div><div class="path-bonus-line">Floor bonus · +${pathBonus('body', state.pathProgress.body) * 3} max health · +${state.pathProgress.body} physical force</div><button class="action-btn" data-action="train-path" data-id="body" ${state.qi < bodyCost || state.stones < 5 ? 'disabled' : ''}>Break through Body floor</button><div class="path-bonus-line">Current floor progress · ${Math.floor(bodyFloorProgress)}%</div></article></div><article class="content-panel path-note"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR FOUNDATION</div><h2>Paths advance at their own pace</h2><p>Qi breakthroughs unlock new realms and trials. Body breakthroughs have their own escalating Qi and stone cost; Spirit ranks continue to strengthen spiritual arts and meditation.</p><div class="feature-stats"><span>QI FLOOR <b>${state.pathProgress.qi}</b></span><span>BODY FLOOR <b>${state.pathProgress.body}</b></span><span>SPIRIT RANK <b>${spiritLevel}</b></span><span>QI FLOW <b>${rateFor().toFixed(1)} / sec · +${(pathBonus('qi', state.pathProgress.qi) * 100).toFixed(0)}%</b></span></div></article><article class="content-panel progression-panel"><div class="eyebrow">REALM PROGRESSION</div><h2>Trials, rewards, and unlocks</h2><p>${gate ? `${gate.label}: ${missing.length ? `Requirements remaining — ${missing.join(' · ')}` : 'All requirements met; gather the Qi threshold to attempt the breakthrough.'}` : 'No additional trial requirements at this floor.'} Successful breakthroughs grant spirit stones and open new paths through the world.</p><div class="progression-unlock-list">${unlockRows}</div></article>`;
  }

